{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream</strong> is a casual adventure with a surreal, poetic heart. Step into the dream world as <strong>Luna</strong>, a little girl searching for the warmth of her lost father\u2019s embrace. Guided by fragments of a poem, you\u2019ll journey through landscapes that blur the line between memory and imagination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 A World Between Dreams and Memories</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>2.5D  world</strong>, where portals transport Luna into hand-painted <strong>2D mazes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each maze is a puzzle of perspective: rotate the environment, shift physics, and uncover hidden paths to reach the dreamcatchers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fragments of the poem and unlock Luna\u2019s memories of her father, piecing together the story of love, loss, and remembrance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/extras/3510f55ce9d11d8740dc129f9d44591e.poster.avif?t=1764607235\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/extras/3510f55ce9d11d8740dc129f9d44591e.webm?t=1764607235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/extras/3510f55ce9d11d8740dc129f9d44591e.mp4?t=1764607235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Emergent Gameplay Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water as a companion</strong>: manipulate streams, currents, and reflections to reshape the world and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light as a guide</strong>: rotate beams to unlock doors, reveal secrets, and illuminate Luna\u2019s path forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover how these elements interact in unexpected ways, creating emergent solutions that feel alive and intuitive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/extras/c6a26c37b7900dc4e6937df898fbe1e0.poster.avif?t=1764607235\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/extras/c6a26c37b7900dc4e6937df898fbe1e0.webm?t=1764607235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/extras/c6a26c37b7900dc4e6937df898fbe1e0.mp4?t=1764607235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 A Surreal Poetic Experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual style inspired by dreams and paintings, blending <strong>hand-crafted 2D art</strong> with <strong>semi-open 2.5D exploration</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative woven from poetry, where every fragment deepens Luna\u2019s emotional journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack that drifts between lullabies and echoes of memory, immersing you in the dreamlike atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/extras/acb04036c2c1627ae14b49dff761db28.avif?t=1764607235\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual yet emotionally resonant gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal dreamscapes with unique physics-based puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergent mechanics with water and light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story told through fragments of a poem and memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted mazes and semi-open world exploration.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030100?t=1764607235","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/bae432c4b7dfc663035378f0d0a4b6d1c7d232d4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764607235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/15298faf225a8f36953752f658b3895d762aaeb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764607235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/15298faf225a8f36953752f658b3895d762aaeb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764607235","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4125900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream</strong> is a casual adventure with a surreal, poetic heart. Step into the dream world as <strong>Luna</strong>, a little girl searching for the warmth of her lost father\u2019s embrace. Guided by fragments of a poem, you\u2019ll journey through landscapes that blur the line between memory and imagination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 A World Between Dreams and Memories</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>2.5D  world</strong>, where portals transport Luna into hand-painted <strong>2D mazes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each maze is a puzzle of perspective: rotate the environment, shift physics, and uncover hidden paths to reach the dreamcatchers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fragments of the poem and unlock Luna\u2019s memories of h